{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09710","headline":"邯郸客舍歌 · 岑参","name":"邯郸客舍歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客从长安来，驱马邯郸道。\n伤心丛台下，一带生蔓草。\n客舍门临漳水边，垂杨下系钓鱼船。\n邯郸女儿夜沽酒，对客挑灯夸数钱。\n酪酊醉时日正午，一曲狂歌垆上眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}